    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lava",
        "text": "What are... these things? Infected creatures?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_144#5",
            "name2": "char_1011_purgatory_1#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kroos",
        "text": "Haven't noticed any signs of infection, though... and you say creatures, but whenever I shoot them, they just turn into black stains and disappear."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_144#5",
            "name2": "char_1011_purgatory_1#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lava",
        "text": "Some kind of Arts?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_144#5",
            "name2": "char_1011_purgatory_1#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kroos",
        "text": "Could be."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_144#5",
            "name2": "char_1011_purgatory_1#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lava",
        "text": "This can't go on. There's too many of them... we need to find the source."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lava",
        "text": "Which direction did they enter the village from?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_144#4",
            "name2": "char_1011_purgatory_1#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kroos",
        "text": "Horizon's getting darker, Lava."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_144#4",
            "name2": "char_1011_purgatory_1#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lava",
        "text": "I know."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_144#1",
            "name2": "char_1011_purgatory_1#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kroos",
        "text": "Still gonna chase 'em?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kroos",
        "text": "We're still not sure how we even got here... things are a little weird. I'm not a fan of getting in too deep right now."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kroos",
        "text": "Even if it's a lead, we don't need to rush that hard."
