    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing",
        "text": "B-Benefactors!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#4",
            "name2": "char_455_nothing_1#3",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lava",
        "text": "Uh, why'd you come with?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#4",
            "name2": "char_455_nothing_1#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing",
        "text": "What nonsense! How could I abandon my benefactors and flee alone?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
            "name2": "char_455_nothing_1#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lava",
        "text": "Do you know what those things are?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
            "name2": "char_455_nothing_1#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing",
        "text": "I\u2014I've never seen them before either... Look at how my legs are trembling..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
            "name2": "char_455_nothing_1#3",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lava",
        "text": "They're not some kind of... Yan specialty, right?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
            "name2": "char_455_nothing_1#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing",
        "text": "As if they could be! If this gallery of oddities were crawling all the lands, they would've long since broken national news!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lava",
        "text": "Kroos, Mr. Nothing, listen to me."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lava",
        "text": "I 'can't remember at all' what happened after I pushed open that wooden cottage door. When I came back to my senses, I was already in that garden listening to the..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_455_nothing_1#6"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing",
        "text": "Umbrella-Boiling Hermit."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lava",
        "text": "Right, listening to the Umbrella-Boiling Hermit tell stories. I have absolutely no impression of how I came to be here. Also, I don't know where 'here' is either."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_144#1",
            "name2": "char_455_nothing_1#6",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kroos",
        "text": "We're all the same."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_144#1",
            "name2": "char_455_nothing_1#6",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing",
        "text": "Benefactor, there's one thing I know for certain. This isn't Ni-weng Village..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing",
        "text": "Though I haven't visited Ni-weng in a few years, the way of the land is fashioned quite old. I ran all the way here just now, and I saw not a single electric cable!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lava",
        "text": "That makes things even tougher..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_144#1",
            "name2": "char_455_nothing_1#6",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kroos",
        "text": "It's just like we're dreaming, eh."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lava",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_144#1",
            "name2": "char_455_nothing_1#6",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kroos",
        "text": "I know what you're thinking, but right now, we've got no other way. We can only trust each other."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_144#1",
            "name2": "char_455_nothing_1#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing",
        "text": "Ho? Benefactors! You shouldn't doubt me now! I'm not the sort of lout that flouts others' graces to him! I'd hardly even be able!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lava",
        "text": "That's not what I meant..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lava",
        "text": "I'm just taking in the situation. Everything's been too strange."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_144#1",
            "name2": "char_455_nothing_1#3",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kroos",
        "text": "We're not saying we don't trust you, Nothing, mate, it's just we need to be cool and think about all the possibilities here."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kroos",
        "text": "Baseline is it's some kind of trap. Whether everything in front of us is real or not.. is a tough question."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_144#1",
            "name2": "char_455_nothing_1#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing",
        "text": "Now, benefactor, don't treat me like I'm young. I may be carefree as the wind, but I'd still wager I'm older than you..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lava",
        "text": "Originium Arts... the possibility's there. But the difficulty's beyond. Is it connected to some specific place? Or did they conjure an outright illusion for us..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_455_nothing_1#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing",
        "text": "You're quite the eccentrics, my benefactors. Any normal person would never be capable of this line of thought under these pressing circumstances."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lava",
        "text": "'Any normal person,' yeah."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lava",
        "text": "Even if we don't know where we are, the geography here is way off."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lava",
        "text": "The sun and moon are fixed in opposite places, most of the houses are built towards the night side here, while the farms and market are on the other end... but the locals seem totally used to it, and just now, those things..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lava",
        "text": "We need information. The faster, the better."
    },
