    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Saga",
        "text": "Oh, the Shopkeeper! What is the matter?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_362_Saga#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_139#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shopkeeper",
        "text": "I heard the bell; that means it's all over, right?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shopkeeper",
        "text": "I heard from Mister I-Ch'uan that some guests from afar helped defend the village. Have you seen them?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_362_Saga#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_139#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Saga",
        "text": "Nay, I have been posted at the bell all this time, have I not? Yet if I had a belltower like unto the one in my monastery, mayhaps I could have seen them from afar."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Saga",
        "text": "To speak of which, I have been here for some time now. This is the first time I have seen the Ink Spirits come in such great waves. Is it mere happenstance?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_362_Saga#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_139#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shopkeeper",
        "text": "That's why I wanted to ask if you could go meet those strangers."
    },
